You are trained in an agile, mobile fighting technique combining sling and shield. This allows shields to be equipped, using Dexterity instead of Strength as a requirement.

While you have a shield equip and your Block talent is not on cooldown, you have a [15%, 25%, 32%, 39%, 45% (TL1-5)] chance to deflect any incoming damage, reducing it by 50% of your shield’s block value.
